tuning.description:
Distribution optimization:
- `default` - for small static files;
- `large` - for large files over 20 MB;
- `live` - for HTTP LIVE streams.

always.description:
Indicates whether to add `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` header:
- `true` - regardless of status code;
- `false` - only for specific status codes.

scope.description:
Execution scope:
- `edge` - on edge nodes;
- `shield` - on intermediate nodes.

type.description:
`robots.txt` operation type:
- `deny` - hide CDN usage;
- `custom` - upload custom `robots.txt`;
- `cached` - proxy `robots.txt`.

message.description:
Status description:
- `dns processing` - DNS settings are being applied;
- `configuration processing` - configuration is being distributed across the network.

action_type.description:
Operation type:
- `single` - by paths list;
- `full` - clear entire domain cache (delete only);
- `playlist` - from `.m3u8` playlist file (preload only).

